    "reviews": "\u201cA hail of bullets is headed your direction, when suddenly, time around you comes to a crawl. In your moment of clarity, you fire a shot into one of the oncoming projectiles and duck under the others. You take a brief moment to catch your breath before repaying your opponents with a flurry of your own shots.\u201d<br>The Geekly Grind<br><br>\u201cNarrowly dodging impromptu bullet-hell attacks looks and feels friggin\u2019 sweet.\u201d<br>NINTENDO ENTHUSIAST<br><br>\u201cA great start to a great party.\u201d<br>Nintendo World Report<br>",
